 =================
 Order Information
 =================

 All of our products come complete with 30-day money-back guarantees.  This includes
 opening the disks to test and use the product during this time.  There are also no
 royalties or runtime fees on any of our libraries.  Our tools can save you 
 valuable programming time while increasing the power and performance of your
 software.  If you have some questions or would like more detailed information 
 sent to you, call us at (800)-451-6174 or (201)-762-8925. Our fax number is
 (201) 762-0118. 

 Our address is:

