 =========================
 Experience and Commitment
 =========================

 South Mountain Software is one of the leading publishers of programmer 
 productivity tools in the DOS marketplace.  You may already know some of our
 products or may be familiar with applications produced with our libraries.
 Many commercial products and in-house systems are built with our tools and 
 libraries.  

 We were established in 1984 to fill the need for C language software development 
 tools.  The idea of building bigger and better tools has grown into a company 
 which now carries ten products and has developed a user base of over 40,000 
 programmers worldwide.  

 All our products are designed to make your job easier and to provide maximum 
 functionality and utility.  We continually update and improve each product and
 make those revisions available to you as they are introduced.


 ==================
 Hands On Guarantee
 ==================

 Skimming through a manual or flyer can only provide you with a small sense of
 what a function library has in store for you.  The problems of compatibility,
 ease of use, executable size and other important information can only be
 found through the actual use of a product. 

 This is why all of our products come with a complete 30 day, no questions
 asked, money back guarantee.  We believe there is no substitute for hands on 
 in evaluating the benefits of a software library.  Once you see how our 
 products save you development time and increase your productivity we feel 
 you will make them a part of your development cycle.

